{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52575","headline":"宴郑协律山亭 · 宋之问","name":"宴郑协律山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝英退食回，追兴洛城隈。\n山瞻二室近，水自陆浑来。\n小径藤间入，高窗竹上开。\n砌花连菡萏，溪柳覆莓苔。\n舞席归云断，歌筵薄景催。\n可怜郊野际，长有故人杯。\n（同前第三四八五页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}